  "body": "A paddle on the water, an afternoon at the playground, or a long lunch on your north-facing deck-life here comes with plenty of perks. With water access and a playground at the bottom of the driveway, this five-bedroom, three-bathroom Devonport home brings together coastal living and room for the whole family.\r\n\r\nThe top floor offers a private retreat, featuring a master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, alongside a living space with its own deck. Sea and Harbour Bridge views complete the picture.\r\n\r\nOn the middle level, the open-plan kitchen, dining and lounge form the heart of the home, flowing onto the north-facing deck for easy entertaining and sunny afternoons. Two additional bedrooms, a family bathroom and a separate toilet complete this floor.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers further flexibility, with two single bedrooms, another living space and a study area-ideal for teenagers, guests or working from home. A bathroom, separate laundry and double garage with internal access add everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nHard-filled block construction finished with plaster render complements the home, while low-maintenance gardens leave more time to enjoy the lifestyle on offer.\r\n\r\nSpace to spread out, views to enjoy and adventure at the end of the driveway. Your next chapter could come with a whole new set of weekend plans.\r\n\r\nCopy and paste this link into your browser to access the property documents:\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/QF8C",
